{%- doc -%}
  Loads the PDP title auto-fit module at its render site.

  Rendered only from BMP-HOOK:pdp-title-fit-close in blocks/product-title.liquid,
  and only when the fit actually engaged (bmp_title_autofit on, real product,
  title 1-48 characters) — the default state ships zero bytes. Duplicate tags
  from several engaged blocks on one page are deduplicated by the browser's
  module map.

  Feature-scoped module — the same shape as
  snippets/bmp-countdown.liquid. All CSS for the feature is static in
  assets/bmp-styles.css (PDP title auto-fit group); this snippet emits no
  styles and no markup beyond the script tag.
{%- enddoc -%}
<script src="{{ 'bmp-title-fit.js' | asset_url }}" type="module" fetchpriority="low"></script>
